econdary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.60<br/>June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nComing out of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Souleater%20Mountains\">Souleater Mountains</a>, you will stumble upon the tainted plantations of Northern <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a>. Many perverted bushes, plants and trees can be sighted at this botanically exclusive area. A pathway leads to <a href=\"#/wiki/Razachai\">Razachai</a>, but the guard won't let just anyone enter the city. One of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Brimstone%20Bug%20Caves\">Brimstone Bug Caves</a> can also be found here.<br/>There is also a tower in the far east portion of the area (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33324,31090,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33324, 31090, 7)</a>), housing a group of <a href=\"#/wiki/Lizards\">lizards</a>. This tower is considerably easier to hunt than the plantations outside as there are at most 6 lizards per floor.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures in and around the plantations</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Insect%